claim.claim-text:
a bottom chip package (10) having a first side (10a) and a second side (10b) opposing the first side (10b), the bottom chip package (10) comprising a package substrate (100) having a core (110) with at least one plated through-hole (112), and at least one build-up layer (120);
a semiconductor chip (30; 30a, 30b) on the first side (10a) or the second side (10b) of the bottom chip package (10);
a discrete antenna device (20) mounted on the first side (10a) of the bottom chip package (10) and having a first radiative antenna element (220); and
conductive elements (240) between the discrete antenna device (20) and the bottom chip package (10) to electrically interconnect the bottom chip package (10) and the discrete antenna device (20).

a top antenna package (2a) comprising a substrate (210) and a radiative antenna element (220), wherein a re-wiring layer (300) is disposed on a first surface of the substrate (210), the re-wiring layer (300) comprising a conductor layer (340) and a solder mask (360);
a semiconductor die (40) mounted on the re-wiring layer (300), wherein the solder mask (360) is between the conductor layer (340) and the semiconductor die (40); and
contact elements (342) between the substrate (210) and the semiconductor die (40) to electrically interconnect to the semiconductor die (40) and the radiative antenna element (220).
